{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decorate book covers to match customers' tastes\u00a0\u2013 or your own, if you feel like it! \u2013 but remember: your actions have consequences. Some will appreciate your creativity, while others\u2026 might not be so pleased.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555780/extras/gif1.gif?t=1744535247\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet many unique characters, each with their own personality and preferences. Find a way to learn their secrets. Who knows, maybe you\u2019ll make a new friend? Or, if fate favors you, a soulmate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555780/extras/gif0.gif?t=1744535247\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in conversations, open new dialogue options, and shape customers'\u00a0destinies  \u2013 for better or worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555780/extras/gif3.gif?t=1744535247\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3555780?t=1744535247","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3555780?t=1744535247","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555780/d21fbe996891d6215a1d2b2e40612db7c1112078/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744535247","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555780/d21fbe996891d6215a1d2b2e40612db7c1112078/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744535247","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decorate book covers to match customers' tastes\u00a0\u2013 or your own, if you feel like it! \u2013 but remember: